WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
One iron tablet, dissolved in dilute
acid and poured into a flask.

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.560
Above it, a burette of
potassium manganate seven.

3
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.240
It's deep purple.

4
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.680
Open the burette.

5
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.940
Each drop lands in the flask,
and its purple simply vanishes.

6
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.040
Nobody has added an indicator.

7
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.920
So how can a purple solution
measure the iron in a tablet?

8
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:26.140
In this mission, you'll build the full
equation from two half-equations,

9
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.420
matching electrons lost
to electrons gained.

10
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:33.720
Then you'll turn a titre into
the mass of iron in one tablet.

11
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:39.160
Your mission: find out how a purple solution
can measure iron with no indicator at all.